# Export every top-level object that does not start with a dot. The
# modules in R/ were written as source()-able files and expose their
# public functions (parse_input, generate_metabolites, compute_envelope,
# build_workbook, ...) plus reference data (STANDARD_DICT,
# REFERENCE_OLIGOS, the bundled drug constants) by
# simple naming convention: internal helpers are dot-prefixed.
exportPattern("^[^.]")
